@startuml
' sequence diagram — exported from Spide
title Library system — Borrow book
skinparam backgroundColor #1D1E22
skinparam defaultFontName "Helvetica Neue"
skinparam defaultFontColor #E6E8EE
skinparam titleFontColor #9AA1B1
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundCorner 12
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
hide circle
skinparam legend {
  BackgroundColor #25272D
  BorderColor #4B5263
  FontColor #9AA1B1
}
skinparam ArrowColor #8A93A6
skinparam ArrowFontColor #9AA1B1
skinparam ArrowFontSize 11
skinparam class {
  BackgroundColor #25272D
  HeaderBackgroundColor #2B2E35
  BorderColor #4B5263
  FontColor #E6E8EE
  FontStyle bold
  AttributeFontColor #E6E8EE
  AttributeFontName Menlo
  AttributeFontSize 12
  StereotypeFontColor #9AA1B1
}
skinparam package {
  BackgroundColor transparent
  FontColor #9AA1B1
  BorderColor #4B5263
}
skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #2B2E35
  BorderColor #FFB454
  FontColor #E6E8EE
}
skinparam sequence {
  LifeLineBorderColor #5D6474
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #25272D
  ParticipantBorderColor #4B5263
  ParticipantFontColor #E6E8EE
  ActorBorderColor #E6E8EE
  ActorBackgroundColor #1D1E22
  ActorFontColor #E6E8EE
  LifeLineBackgroundColor #30343D
  ArrowColor #E6E8EE
}
autoactivate on

actor Member
participant LoanController
participant LendingService
participant LoanRepository

Member -> LoanController : 1: borrow(id, isbn)
LoanController -> LendingService : 2: lend()
LendingService -> LoanRepository : 3: save()
LoanRepository --> LendingService : ok
LendingService -[#FF5C6C]> LoanRepository : 4: explode() <color:#FF5C6C>✗ LoanRepository.explode() does not exist</color>
LendingService --> LoanController : loan
@enduml

